<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>PAT-HOT · P量子信息与计算</title><link>https://sun-zihang.github.io/pat-hot/#/all</link><description>量子信息与计算</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:24:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Supercurrent enables the reading of quantum information without destroying it</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-supercurrent-enables-quantum-destroying.html</link><description>One of the fundamental challenges of quantum computing is obtaining information from a quantum bit, or qubit. Unlike a conventional bit, which can be read repeatedly without altering its content, direct measurement of a quantum system typically causes the state to collapse before it can be determined. In other words, reading the information modifies it.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">b30f520a2d0b</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:24:20 GMT</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>量子信息与计算</category></item><item><title>Ultrafast single-qubit gates through multi-photon transition removal</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-78373-4</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">4e7e23d911e8</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:24:20 GMT</pubDate><source>Nature 量子物理</source><category>量子信息与计算</category></item><item><title>Simultaneous high-fidelity single-qubit gates in a spin qubit array</title><link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41567-026-03466-2</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">f547e2cca689</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:24:20 GMT</pubDate><source>Nature 量子物理</source><category>量子信息与计算</category></item><item><title>中国量子计算可否跳出“追赶陷阱”？</title><link>http://www.zhishifenzi.com/depth/depth/10718.html</link><description>计算对于人类进步的重要性已毋庸置疑。凭借颠覆现有技术体系的巨大潜力，量子计算已成为备受瞩目的前沿科技之一，也是国际科技竞争的关键领域。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">7ef928ac1000</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:24:20 GMT</pubDate><source>知识分子</source><category>量子信息与计算</category></item><item><title>Beating the break-even point with autono